pplications. ICON virtual synchronous networking (VSN) preserves the performance characteristics of time-division multiplexing (TDM) when converting to Ethernet as a transport protocol. By combining TDM and Ethernet transport options with a comprehensive range of data interfaces, the ICON makes it easy to migrate legacy network technologies to a converged IT/OT packet-based solution. </p>","title":"ICON","folderId":98740,"xmlConfigurationId":97717,"contentIds":[110295],"allowedGroups":[]},"smartForm":{"subtitle":"Integrated Communications Optical Network","selectDownloads":[{"id":105168,"allowedGroups":[]},{"id":9326,"allowedGroups":[]},{"id":7582,"allowedGroups":[]}],"allowedGroups":[]},"smartFormType":"Repositories.Smartforms.Product","contentIds":[110295],"metadata":{"searchTypes":"product|product-detail"},"allowedGroups":[]},{"content":{"id":109454,"image":"uploadedImages/_New_Site/Products/AR360-AROH_2026.png?n=63910142126000","language":"en","quicklink":"/products/AR/","teaser":"<p>Overhead AutoRANGER Fault Indicators are self-adjusting fault indicators for overhead lines. You can apply the SEL<font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">-</span></font>AR360 on distribution systems up to 35 kV and the SEL-AR on systems up to 69 kV for permanent and momentary fault indication using bright LEDs and flash patterns.</p>","title":"LINAM AR360 and LINAM AR","folderId":98740,"xmlConfigurationId":97717,"contentIds":[109454],"allowedGroups":[]},"smartForm":{"subtitle":"Overhead AutoRANGER Fault Indicators","allowedGroups":[]},"smartFormType":"Repositories.Smartforms.Product","contentIds":[109454],"metadata":{"searchTypes":"product|product-detail"},"allowedGroups":[]},{"content":{"id":109472,"image":"uploadedImages/Web/Products/Images/LZ_Product_TBN-6 (1).jpg?n=63864858745000","language":"en","quicklink":"/products/ARU/","teaser":"<p>SEL Underground AutoRANGER Fault Indicators are reliable, self-adjusting, settings-free faulted cir